##### Wherever you go,

I like browsing the web. Not scrolling feeds, but the actual web, leaving a trail of browser history and opening too many tabs.

Clicking here and there often leads me to one rabbit hole after another, from a regular story to a piece of obscure knowledge to another fun web toy.

More often than not, I find myself coming back to the same websites for regular updates, or the same web curators for small doses of internet curiosities.

##### there you are.

Over the years, I’ve tried using different RSS and reading apps, but most either feel like another never-ending feed or are too feature-heavy. Sometimes I just need a categorized overview to find out what my corner of the internet’s up to. I hope to make space for "I want to know more about this", rather than "I read this because it's there".

Inspired by Brutalist Report, I made this as a personal spot for what I'm interested in at the moment. And right now, that's enough for one more tab.

